    "body": "We have `impl From<&[T]> for Value` and `impl From<Vec<T>> for Value`, why don't we support the conversion from an array?\r\n\r\n```rust\r\nimpl<T: Into<Value>, const N: usize> From<[T; N]> for Value {\r\n    fn from(array: [T; N]) -> Self {\r\n        let vec = array.into_iter().map(|v| v.into()).collect();\r\n        Self::Array(vec)\r\n    }\r\n}\r\n```",
